{"id":"impe-framework","name":"impe-framework","aliases":[],"caption":"A XeLaTeX framework for building documents from reusable components","authors":[{"id":"yang-s","active":false}],"copyright":[{"owner":"Sikai Yang","year":"2026"}],"license":"mit","version":{"number":"1.0.1","date":""},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n     IMPE is a modular XeLaTeX framework designed to keep document setup simple\n     even when the underlying typesetting is not. Layouts, fonts, and optional\n     features can be selected through a small set of common interfaces, so ordinary\n     documents do not need to expose the framework’s internal structure.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n     It provides ready-to-use classes for several document types while keeping\n     layouts, font configurations, and features reusable and extensible. More\n     specialized facilities, including multilingual and script-specific\n     typesetting, can be added when needed without making the basic workflow more\n     complicated.\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":"zh-tw","details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/impe-framework/manual/zh-tw/impe-manual-zh-tw.pdf"},{"language":"en","details":"Package showcase","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/impe-framework/manual/showcase/impe-showcase.pdf"},{"language":"en","details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/impe-framework/manual/en/impe-manual-en.pdf"},{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/impe-framework/README.md"},{"language":"de","details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/impe-framework/manual/de/impe-manual-de.pdf"}],"home":"https://github.com/KelvinYangBK67/IMPE-LaTeX-System","bugs":"https://github.com/KelvinYangBK67/IMPE-LaTeX-System/issues","repository":"https://github.com/KelvinYangBK67/IMPE-LaTeX-System","ctan":{"path":"/macros/xetex/latex/impe-framework","file":true},"miktex":"impe-framework","texlive":"impe-framework","topics":["repo